eni Şafak English","d":"2026-10-24T07:29:35Z","o":false,"dup":false},{"t":"Saudi-led coalition claims intercepting Houthi drone, missile, Houthis report Saudi airstrikes","u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","p":"巴士的報","d":"2026-10-24T09:40:00Z","o":false,"dup":false},{"t":"Saudi Arabia intercepts Houthi missiles near Mecca and Medina","u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE9iT3BOTjNLUVJkOXhfWWYtbmFWN2tCY0MxQkpxLTNYRnp2ZUQ1VGRVYm5KR3dmZlRhLVJuQUhHU01vaW5oVi1oQ3paSUFFTWJwR3o0NU1wcXUyQzFq?oc=5","p":"The Jerusalem Post","d":"2026-10-24T17:18:38Z","o":false,"dup":false}],"related":[],"revisions":[],"entities":[{"name":"Houthi","kind":"organisation","mentions":10},{"name":"Saudi","kind":"group","mentions":7},{"name":"Riyadh","kind":"place","mentions":5},{"name":"Najran","kind":"place","mentions":3},{"name":"Saudi Arabia","kind":"place","mentions":3},{"name":"Anadolu Agency","kind":"organisation","mentions":1}],"disputes":[],"summary":{"text":"On October 22, 2026, Saudi-led forces intercepted a Houthi missile targeting Najran, a city in southwestern Saudi Arabia. This interception occurred on October 23, 2026, according to the Times of Israel. The Houthis, who have been launching missiles and armed drones at Israel in response to the Gaza war, have also seized or attacked dozens of merchant and naval vessels traveling through the Red Sea. This action provoked a military response from Israel, as well as the United States and the United Kingdom.","text_hi":null,"model":"qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf","created_at":"2026-10-23T13:32:09Z"},"context":{"background":[{"title":"Red Sea crisis","extract":"The Red Sea crisis is an ongoing armed conflict and maritime crisis instigated by the Houthis, an armed group in Yemen fighting a civil war against the country's internationally recognized government. The Houthis began launching missiles and armed drones at Israel in response to the Gaza war, and have seized or attacked dozens of merchant and naval vessels travelling through the Red Sea which they claimed are linked to Israel. These actions provoked a military response from Israel, as well as the United States and the United Kingdom. The crisis is linked to the Middle Eastern crisis, the Iran–Israel proxy conflict, and the Yemeni crisis.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Sea_crisis","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"places":[{"title":"Saudi Arabia","extract":"Saudi Arabia, officially the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia (KSA), is a country in West Asia that occupies the bulk of the Arabian Peninsula. Covering a land area of approximately 2,149,690 km2 (830,000 sq mi), it is the fifth-largest country in Asia and the twelfth-largest in the world. It is bordered by the Red Sea to the west, Jordan, Iraq, and Kuwait to the north, the Persian Gulf, Bahrain, Qatar, and the United Arab Emirates to the east, Oman to the southeast, and Yemen to the south. The Gulf of Aqaba in the northwest separates it from Egypt and Israel. Riyadh is the capital and largest city, while other major centers include Jeddah and the two holiest cities in Islam, Mecca and Medina.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saudi_Arabia","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"SA"},{"title":"Yemen","extract":"Yemen, officially the Republic of Yemen, is a country in West Asia. Located in southern Arabia, the country includes the Socotra Archipelago and borders Saudi Arabia to the north, Oman to the northeast, the Arabian Sea to the east, the Gulf of Aden to the south, and the Red Sea to the west. It also shares maritime borders with Djibouti, Eritrea, and Somalia across the Horn of Africa. Covering 455,503 square kilometres (175,871 sq mi), with a coastline of approximately 2,000 kilometres (1,200 mi), Yemen is the second-largest country on the Arabian Peninsula by both area and population. Sanaa is its constitutional capital and largest city. Yemen's population is estimated at 34.7 million, predominantly Muslim Arabs.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yemen","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"YE"}],"arc":{"reports":132,"first_seen":"2026-10-10T16:04:56Z","first_title":"Riyadh King Khalid International Airport Hit By Ballistic Missile: Initial Reports Suggest 'Mass Casualty Event'","first_url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","first_publisher":"PYOK","earlier":[{"id":"e_9810fb4f21fe","title":"Saudi Arabia, the Missile Factory and the Strategic Balance with Iran","date":"2026-10-23T17:56:48Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPMmVDcnl2dWRtU1o4dXAtb3B3bGZDWC1WYnFXbGtnWm1JYUlEa0FkcUNUYjlVTm5oQWVheUdjRklCdzBSQW5rRF9EZWhTbFJFMzFhZnpVcVBrcFFxU2RhREFuUW9yRVUyMFF1NGJKd3JNR0N3THg2eGNkMEh4NG14WmRTOHZQU1c5VXRIcEtNaWFocFRLNDdRcDFaZnBvOE0?oc=5","publisher":"Istituto Analisi Relazioni Internazionali","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_2f3f4f20e1f3","title":"Coalition forces down missile and drone as Houthis keep up strikes on Saudi Arabia","date":"2026-10-24T02:00:01Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNTURBeEgzbzVmaEx3ZGNUbkI1Qi04NmMxVFpMd05Dc2dIM01hd3hxTFQ4QkRaOXEyUHRmcEtBRVE4ZmhYMlo2QUF4RGthMVdKZ0RQQXBNc1hWbjRNd2tPcVVXdE1nTU1JYThXelBTaTVwS3ZfZnc3RVVfODdfNEJXMFhRcWIxYnRzcUtBaUFQbXZ2bVNqWkhmQUtLTk5Sb21ZWjNLb19lTk5xSGNYZFNsT3RXSHFOR2dlWlRlTzJTUmZBTVZaM1JZ?oc=5","publisher":"Arab News","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_e31ffb691206","title":"Saudi Arabia intercepts Houthi missile as Trump threatens new strikes","date":"2026-10-24T03:53:38Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOM3Q0VzRBZWhZNVhHVktIVEVTdnJhQlduNnNTb3ZpNjBEVVZsQXh5Uk5SZUt3aEU0UVZlUXlMbW5iYWx3bHlEUGtUYXVrRjZYbF9lR1BzOTdUWkFrSFEwYmFfSF83WGNHSkFfVmt2TUd0aHZ2eGhXY3ltczdWYW1mTlZjRUlsVS0zZ1ltNDVCOW1nSzBlNVF1SjJ2NVkwWjU1RmRqd1hXRTYwUUh4UUpJbVN2ZjdpVEVIV2tZdWVR?oc=5","publisher":"Investing.com","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_4b82dae9c443","title":"Saudi Arabia on alert: Missile threats trigger emergency warnings across four 